# A dialog with a single button focuses its own box over a covered page ("Continue watching?"): with one control inside, the box was taken for a wrapper around it, and no arrow ever reached the button. The ring enters the dialog, and Enter answers it.
pages/dialog-one-button.html
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#yes
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#yes
key:Enter
wait:200
eval:(() => { if (document.getElementById('yes')) throw new Error('dialog still open'); return 'closed'; })()
